# Order State Machine - FA2

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PLACED : Order Created
    
    PLACED --> ACCEPTED : Staff Accepts
    PLACED --> REJECTED : Staff Rejects (with reason)
    PLACED --> CANCELLED : Customer Cancels
    
    ACCEPTED --> PREPARING : Staff Starts Preparation
    ACCEPTED --> REJECTED : Staff Rejects (with reason)
    ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : Customer Cancels
    
    PREPARING --> READY_FOR_PICKUP : Preparation Complete
    
    READY_FOR_PICKUP --> PICKED_UP : Delivery Partner Pickup
    READY_FOR_PICKUP --> DELIVERY_FAILED : Delivery Issue
    
    PICKED_UP --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY : In Transit
    
    OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED : Delivery Complete
    OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERY_FAILED : Delivery Issue
    
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    DELIVERED --> [*]
    DELIVERY_FAILED --> [*]
```
